# Copy to CODEOWNERS in the repository root.
#
# CODEOWNERS is NOT a community health file — it does not fall back to the org .github
# repo, so every repository needs its own copy. That is why this is a template.
#
# The rulesets require code-owner review, so a path with no owner is a path nobody has to
# look at. Prefer a catch-all plus specific overrides.

* @arklabsai/owners

# Narrow it where it helps: engineers own the application, owners keep the paths that
# cost money or hold secrets.
# /apps/          @arklabsai/engineers
# /packages/      @arklabsai/engineers
# /infra/         @arklabsai/owners
# /.github/       @arklabsai/owners
